0	section	Talking to Katrine
1	line	Player	What is this place?
1	line	Katrine	It's a private business. Can I help you at all?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	I've heard you're the Black Arm Gang.
2	line	Player	I've heard you're the Black Arm Gang.
2	line	Katrine	Who told you that?
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	I'd rather not reveal my sources.
3	line	Player	I'd rather not reveal my sources.
3	line	Katrine	Hmm... I suppose I can understand that. So, say we were the Black Arm Gang, what would you want with us?
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	I want to become a member of your gang.
4	line	Player	I want to become a member of your gang.
4	action	Continues after "How unusual..."
3	option	I want some hints on becoming a thief.
4	line	Player	I want some hints on becoming a thief.
4	line	Katrine	Do you now? And what makes you think I'll provide anything like that?
4	line	Player	Well, how about I become a member of your gang in return?
4	line	Katrine	How unusual... Okay, let's say we are who you believe we are. Do you think we'd be recruiting people who just waltz in here saying 'hello, I'd like to play'?
4	line	Player	I don't know. What would be the alternative?
4	line	Katrine	Watching local thugs and thieves in action, perhaps? How do I know I can just trust someone who's wandered in here.
4	select	Select an option
4	option	Well, you can give me a try can't you?
4	line	Player	Well, you can give me a try can't you?
4	line	Katrine	I'm not so sure...
4	action	Continues below from "Thinking about it..."
4	option	Well, people tell me I have an honest face.
5	line	Player	Well, people tell me I have an honest face.
5	line	Katrine	Someone honest wanting to join a gang of thieves? Excuse me if I remain unconvinced...
5	line	Katrine	Thinking about it... I may have a solution actually. You may have heard of the Phoenix Gang. I hear they have a very nice weapons stash not too far from here.
5	line	Katrine	We're fresh out of crossbows, but apparently they have plenty. If someone were to acquire a couple for us, it would be very much appreciated.
5	line	Player	Sounds simple enough. Any particular reason you need them?
5	line	Katrine	Let's just say there's a local merchant who is refusing to pay some very reasonable 'keep-your-life-pleasant' insurance rates.
5	line	Player	So you're planning to murder him?
5	line	Katrine	Him? No. However, I hear that the local law might soon be finding a crossbow belonging to the Phoenix Gang in his home...
5	line	Katrine	I also hear that a similar type of crossbow might soon be used in a murder on the other side of the city...
5	line	Katrine	Now, are you going to keep asking questions, or are you going to go get those crossbows?
5	option	Okay, no problem.
6	line	Player	Okay, no problem.
6	line	Katrine	Great! Apparently the Phoenix Gang's weapons stash is somewhere to the east. Ask that tramp outside. I'm sure he'll know more.
6	action	end
5	option	Sounds a little tricky. Got anything easier?
6	line	Player	Sounds a little tricky. Got anything easier?
6	line	Katrine	If you're not up for a little bit of danger, I don't think you've got anything to offer us.
6	select	Select an option
6	option	Okay, I'll do it.
7	line	Player	Okay, I'll do it.
7	line	Katrine	Great! Apparently the Phoenix Gang's weapons stash is somewhere to the east. Ask that tramp outside. I'm sure he'll know more.
7	action	end
6	option	It's a no from me then.
7	line	Player	It's a no from me then.
7	line	Katrine	Then get lost!
7	action	end
3	option	I'm looking for the door out of here.
4	line	Player	I'm looking for the door out of here.
4	line	Katrine	Try... the one you just came through?
4	action	end
2	option	It was Charlie, the tramp outside.
3	line	Player	It was Charlie, the tramp outside.
3	line	Katrine	Is that guy still out there? He's getting to be a nuisance. Might be time for him to have a little accident...
3	line	Katrine	Anyway, say we were the Black Arm Gang, what would you want with us?
3	action	Continues above after "Say we were the Black Arm Gang, what would you want with us?"
2	option	Everyone knows. It's no great secret.
3	line	Player	Everyone knows. It's no great secret.
3	line	Katrine	What?! You must be joking!
3	line	Player	Oh no, not at all... It's so obvious! Even the town guard have caught on...
3	line	Katrine	I see... Well... say we were the Black Arm Gang, what would you want with us?
3	action	Continues above after "Say we were the Black Arm Gang, what would you want with us?"
1	option	What sort of business?
2	line	Player	What sort of business?
2	line	Katrine	A small, family business. We give financial advice to other companies. Now, if you'll excuse me.
2	action	end
1	option	I'm looking for fame and riches.
2	line	Player	I'm looking for fame and riches.
2	line	Katrine	And you expect to find that up the back streets of Varrock? Keep dreaming.
2	action	end
