1	select	Select an option
1	option	Can you sell me some furs?
1	option	Can you tell me where I can find the Phoenix Gang?
2	line	Player	Can you tell me where I can find the Phoenix Gang?
2	line	Baraek	Shh, shh, shh! Not so loud! You don't want to get me in trouble, do you?
2	line	Player	So I take it that you do know where they are.
2	line	Baraek	I may do... but I don't want to get into trouble for revealing their hideout. Of course, if I was, say 20 coins richer, I may happen to be more inclined to take that sort of risk...
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	Okay. Have 20 gold coins.
3	line	Player	Okay. Have 20 gold coins.
3	cond	If the player has 20 coins.
4	action	
4	line	Baraek	Okay, to get to the gang hideout, head to the southern gates of the city and then head down the alleyway past the Blue Moon Inn.
4	line	Baraek	Down there you'll find a building owned by the VTAM corporation. That's where you'll find the Phoenix Gang. Just be careful. They ain't the types to be messed about.
4	line	Player	Thanks!
4	action	end
3	cond	If the player doesn't have 20 coins.
4	line	Player	Uh... oops. I don't actually have 20 coins. Silly me.
4	action	end
