0	section	Talking to Straven or attempting to open the door
1	line	Player	What's through that door?
1	line	Straven	You can't go in there. Only authorised personnel of the VTAM Corporation are allowed beyond this point.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	I know who you are!
2	line	Player	I know who you are!
2	line	Straven	Really? Well? Who are we then?
2	line	Player	This is the headquarters of one of the most dangerous crime syndicates this city has ever seen! The Phoenix Gang!
2	line	Straven	No, this is a legitimate business run by legitimate individuals. However... supposing we were this crime gang, what would you want with us?
2	select	Select an option
2	option	I'd like to offer you my services.
3	line	Player	I'd like to offer you my services.
3	line	Straven	You mean you'd like to join the Phoenix Gang? Well, obviously I can't speak for them, but the Phoenix Gang doesn't let people join just like that. First, you'd need to prove your loyalty.
3	line	Player	How would I go about doing that?
3	line	Straven	Obviously, I would have no idea. Although, having said that, a rival gang of ours, er, theirs, called the Black Arm Gang is supposedly meeting a contact from Port Sarim today.
3	line	Straven	Apparently the meeting is going to take place in the Blue Moon Inn, and supposedly the contact is none other than the notorious mass murderer turned pirate captain, Jonny the Beard.
3	line	Straven	Now, obviously I know nothing about the dealings of the Phoenix Gang, but I bet if somebody were to arrange an accident for Jonny and bring back his intelligence report, the gang would be very pleased.
3	line	Player	I see... I'm sure I can help sort something out for them. I'll get right on it.
3	action	end
2	option	I want nothing. I was just making sure you were them.
3	line	Player	I want nothing. I was just making sure you were them.
3	line	Straven	Well then get lost and stop wasting my time.
3	action	end
1	option	How do I get a job with the VTAM corporation?
2	line	Player	How do I get a job with the VTAM corporation?
2	line	Straven	Get a copy of the Varrock Herald. If we have any positions right now, they'll be advertised in there.
2	action	end
1	option	Fair enough.
2	line	Player	Fair enough.
2	action	end
