3	line	Straven	Very good... Very good... Okay, I'm satisfied. Welcome to the Phoenix Gang! I'm Straven, one of the gang leaders.
3	line	Player	Nice to meet you. I'm {player}.
3	line	Straven	As a member of our gang, you now have access to our hideout and our weapons supply depot. The hideout is just through this door and the depot is two doors down from here. You'll need this key to get in.
3	box	Straven hands you a key.
3	line	Straven	Once again, welcome to the Phoenix Gang!
3	action	end
0	section	Talking to Straven after joining the Phoenix Gang
1	line	Straven	Greetings, fellow gang member.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	I've heard you've got some cool treasures in this place.
2	line	Player	I've heard you've got some cool treasures in this place.
2	line	Straven	Oh yeah, we've all stolen some stuff in our time. Our candlesticks down here, for example, were quite a challenge to get out of the palace.
2	line	Player	And the Shield of Arrav?
2	line	Straven	Woah... that's a blast from the past! We stole that years and years ago!
2	line	Straven	Truth be told, we don't even have the whole shield anymore. A few years ago there was a big fight within the gang and the shield got broken in half as a result.
2	line	Straven	After the fight, some gang members split off and formed their own group. They took one half of the shield with them.
2	line	Player	This other group? The Black Arm Gang?
2	line	Straven	Indeed.
2	action	other
1	option	Any suggestions for where I can go thieving?
2	line	Player	Any suggestions for where I can go thieving?
2	line	Straven	You could always try the marketplace over in Ardougne. Lots of opportunity there!
2	action	other
1	option	Where's the Black Arm Gang hideout?
2	line	Player	Where's the Black Arm Gang hideout?
2	line	Straven	Interested in spying on the enemy, are you? It will be tricky. Their security is pretty good. Not as good as ours obviously, but still good.
2	line	Straven	Still, if you really want to go there, it's down an alleyway near the southern gate. One of our contacts, a tramp going by the name of Charlie, keeps an eye on it. He may be able to help you.
2	line	Player	I see. Thanks for the help!
2	action	other
1	option	I'd better get going.
2	line	Player	I'd better get going.
2	action	end
