1	option	I'm looking for the Black Arm Gang.
2	line	Player	I'm looking for the Black Arm Gang.
2	line	Charlie the Tramp	Like I told you, the rumour is that they have their headquarters right down this alleyway. Though if I were you, I'd be careful about messing with them...
2	line	Player	Do you think they would let me join?
2	line	Charlie the Tramp	No. You're a collaborator with the Phoenix Gang. There's no way they'll let you join.
2	select	Select an option
2	option	How did you know I was in the Phoenix Gang?
3	line	Player	How did you know I was in the Phoenix Gang?
3	line	Charlie the Tramp	I've been known to have dealings with the Phoenix Gang. I wouldn't be very good at my job if I didn't know their members.
3	line	Player	I see. So, any ideas how I could get in there?
3	line	Charlie the Tramp	Your best bet would probably be to find someone who isn't a member of the Phoenix Gang and get them to infiltrate the ranks of the Black Arm Gang for you.
3	line	Player	Someone? Like who?
3	line	Charlie the Tramp	There's plenty of other adventurers about besides yourself. I'm sure if you asked one of them nicely they would help you.
3	line	Player	I see...
3	action	end
