0	section	Talking to Reldo with half of the shield
1	line	Reldo	Hello there, {player}.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	I've found half of the Shield of Arrav!
2	line	Player	I've found half of the Shield of Arrav!
2	line	Reldo	Half?
2	line	Player	Yes. It seems it was split in two.
2	line	Reldo	I see... Where did you find this half?
2	line	Player	The Phoenix Gang had it. I managed to infiltrate their gang and steal it from them.
2	line	Reldo	A split gang and a split shield. My guess would be that the other gang has the other half.
2	line	Player	Well, I don't think I'll have much luck infiltrating the Black Arm Gang now that I've joined their rivals, but maybe someone else will be able to.
2	line	Reldo	Let's hope so. In the meantime, you should probably head over to the museum so they can verify the authenticity of this half.
2	action	end
