0	section	Finishing up
0	section	Talking to Curator Haig Halen
1	line	Player	Hello there. I'm here about the Shield of Arrav.
1	line	Curator Haig Halen	The Shield of Arrav? The Museum has been searching for that for years! The late King Roald II offered a generous reward for its return!
1	line	Player	Well, I'm here to claim it.
1	line	Curator Haig Halen	You've found the shield? Let's have a look!
1	box	You show the shield half to the curator.
1	line	Curator Haig Halen	This is incredible! But where's the other half?
1	line	Player	I obtained this half from the [Phoenix Gang/Black Arm Gang]. The [Black Arm Gang/Phoenix Gang] might have the other half.
1	line	Curator Haig Halen	That does sound plausible. We will have to hope that another adventurer can recover that half.
1	line	Player	So will I be rewarded for recovering half of the shield?
1	line	Curator Haig Halen	I'm afraid the reward is for the recovery of the full shield. However, what I'll do is write you out two half- certificates. If another adventurer returns the other shield half, I'll do the same for them.
1	line	Curator Haig Halen	The two of you can then swap one of the half- certificates to make a full one each. Take that to the King and he will grant you your reward.
1	box	The curator gives you two half-certificates.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to the Curator again after giving him the shield half
1	line	Curator Haig Halen	Welcome to the museum of Varrock.
1	line	Player	Hello there. I'm here about the Shield of Arrav.
1	line	Curator Haig Halen	I gave you two half-certificates for the half you returned. If another adventurer returns the other shield half, I'll do the same for them.
1	line	Curator Haig Halen	The two of you can then swap one of the half-certificates to make a full one each. Take that to the King and he will grant you your reward.
1	line	Player	Would it be okay to get more half-certificates?
1	line	Curator Haig Halen	I suppose so. It's not like you can do anything with them without the other half.
1	box	The curator gives you two half-certificates.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to King Roald without a full certificate
1	line	Player	Greetings, your majesty.
1	line	King Roald	Yes, citizen. Do you need something?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	I'm here about the Shield of Arrav.
2	line	Player	I'm here about the Shield of Arrav.
2	cond	If the player has a shield half:
3	line	King Roald	The Shield of Arrav? Yes, I do recall my father put a reward out for that.
3	line	Player	Well, I've managed to find half the shield!
3	line	King Roald	You have? Well, before we go any further, you'll need to get the authenticity of the shield verified by the curator at the museum.
3	line	Player	Okay. I'll head over there.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player has a half-certificate:
3	box	You show the certificate half to the king.
3	line	King Roald	I'm afraid that's only half the reward certificate. You'll have to get the other half and join them together if you want to claim the reward.
3	action	end
1	option	Not really.
0	section	Talking to King Roald with a full certificate
1	line	Player	Greetings, your majesty.
1	line	King Roald	Yes, citizen. Do you need something?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	I'm here about the Shield of Arrav.
2	line	Player	I'm here about the Shield of Arrav.
2	box	You show the certificate to the king.
2	line	King Roald	My goodness! This is for the reward offered by my father many years ago! I never thought I would live to see the day when someone came forward to claim it!
2	line	Player	It was quite the undertaking. I wouldn't have been able to do it without help from a fellow adventurer.
2	line	King Roald	Well, in that case, it's only right that you both be rewarded. I will grant half of the reward to you and half to your companion. That means 600 coins for you. Enjoy it! You've very much earned it!
2	action	end
1	option	Not really.
