0	section	Talking to Straven as a member of the Phoenix Gang
1	line	Straven	Greetings, fellow gang member.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	I've heard you've got some cool treasures in this place.
1	line	Player	I've heard you've got some cool treasures in this place.
1	line	Straven	Oh yeah, we've all stolen some stuff in our time. Our candlesticks down here, for example, were quite a challenge to get out of the palace.
1	line	Player	And the Shield of Arrav?
1	line	Straven	Once one of our most prized possessions.
1	line	Player	Once?
1	line	Straven	It seems the Black Arm Gang weren't content with having one half. They recently stole the other half of the shield from us as well!
1	line	Player	Oh no! I'll be sure to keep an eye out for any of their members sneaking around.
